        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 13</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ sy ælc cyrice on Godes griþe ⁊ on þæs cynges ⁊ on ealles Cristenes folces.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every church shall be under the special protection of God and of the king and of all Christian people.</ab>
